{"content":[{"c":["NAAMAH (P",{"c":["erson"],"sourceClass":"lc","t":"span"},")"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Daughter of Zillah and Lamech in the list of Cain’s descendants (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.4.22","r":"Gen.4.22","rawR":"Gen.4.22","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.4.22","value":"Gen.4.22"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 4:22"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. One of Solomon’s many wives, an Ammonitess (",{"href":"?bref=1Kgs.14.21,31","r":"1Kgs.14.21,31","rawR":"1Kgs.14.21,31","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Kgs.14.21,31","value":"1Kgs.14.21,31"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Kgs 14:21, 31"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.12.13","r":"2Chr.12.13","rawR":"2Chr.12.13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.12.13","value":"2Chr.12.13"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 12:13"},"). She was surely responsible in part for Solomon’s idolatry. Her son Rehoboam ruled Judah after Solomon’s death (",{"href":"?bref=1Kgs.14.21-24","r":"1Kgs.14.21-24","rawR":"1Kgs.14.21-24","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Kgs.14.21-24","value":"1Kgs.14.21-24"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Kgs 14:21-24"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"NaamahPerson","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Gn 4:22","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.4.22","rawQueryValue":"Gen.4.22","sourceRefExact":"Gen.4.22"},{"anchorText":"1 Kgs 14:21, 31","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Kgs.14.21,31","rawQueryValue":"1Kgs.14.21,31","sourceRefExact":"1Kgs.14.21,31"},{"anchorText":"2 Chr 12:13","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.12.13","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.12.13","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.12.13"},{"anchorText":"1 Kgs 14:21-24","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Kgs.14.21-24","rawQueryValue":"1Kgs.14.21-24","sourceRefExact":"1Kgs.14.21-24"}],